      ),
      border: Border.all(color: const Color(0xffc99c68)),
      boxShadow: const [BoxShadow(blurRadius: 12, color: Colors.black)],
    ),
    child: Text(text, style: const TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.bold)),
  );

